eapest car):\n\n- **Hotel:** Montmartre Suites, \u20ac110 \u00d7 3 nights = **\u20ac330**\n- **Car rental:** Paris Rent-a-Car, \u20ac45 \u00d7 3 days = **\u20ac135**\n- **Meals:** Miznon, \u20ac15 \u00d7 2 meals \u00d7 3 days = **\u20ac90**\n\n**Total minimum \u2248 \u20ac555** (excluding fuel, flights, and taxes)\n\n## My recommendations\n- **Hotel:** Montmartre Suites (cheapest verified) \u2014 *but I couldn't confirm its rating*\n- **Car rental:** Paris Rent-a-Car (4.5\u2605, \u20ac45/day)\n- **Restaurant:** Miznon (4.3\u2605, \u20ac15/person)\n\nWould you like me to try re-fetching the blocked hotel/restaurant ratings another way, or go ahead and book any of these? I'd recommend confirming the hotel rating before committing, since that's the one gap in the data."
